# KORVANE COLD CHAIN — CALIBRATION CERTIFICATE

Form KC-CAL-T, issue 4, valid from 01.03.2024 (replaces issue 3 of 2022). To be completed in ink or by the KC-Service Tool export. Fields marked with an asterisk are mandatory; a certificate with an empty mandatory field is void and must be reissued with a new number.

Certificate no.*: KCC-2024-_____ (five digits, assigned in running order by Bay 3; the numbers are never reused, even if a certificate is cancelled)

