2. Retention period 7 years.
3. Customers under a pharma contract receive the certificate within 24 hours after the calibration, others within 5 working days.
4. Forms printed before 01.03.2024 (issue 3) must be destroyed; the old form had only a two-point temperature check, which is not accepted any more.
5. Issue 4 was approved by Benedikta Aaltonen on 26 February 2024.

